[h1]Blueprints Included[/h1]

Copy any structure you have built — walls, wiring, plumbing and the building settings that go
with them — and stamp it down again anywhere.

[hr][/hr]

[h1]A fork of Blueprints Expanded[/h1]

This is a standalone fork of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3468585385]Blueprints Expanded[/url]
by SGT_Imalas, which is itself a rewrite of Mayall's original Blueprints mod.

[b]Do not run this and Blueprints Expanded at the same time.[/b] They have different mod IDs, so
the game will happily enable both — but they share a code base and patch the same parts of the
game. Enable one, disable the other.

Blueprints made with Blueprints Expanded, the original Blueprints mod, or its fixed version are
imported and work here.

[hr][/hr]
[h1]Features[/h1]
[list][*] Storing and placing of blueprints - copy large structures in an instant
[*] Snapshot tool - quick copying without creating a blueprint, including a local clipboard history
[*] Blueprint Selection UI - pick from all your blueprints, arranged as a list with folders, icons and tints
[*] Blueprint Info UI - view the details of a blueprint's composition before placing it
[*] Compatible with existing blueprints - blueprints from the original mod (and its fixed version) are imported
[*] Settings Transfer - blueprints store building settings on creation and apply them when placed (does not apply to blueprints from the old mod)
[*] Material Swapping - preview the material list when placing, swap missing materials for available ones, and save those swaps as new copies
[*] Apply Settings from blueprint - paste a blueprint onto existing buildings to transfer stored settings
[*] Force rebuild with blueprint materials - hold "F" to rebuild existing buildings with the material the blueprint specifies
[*] Rebuilding Settings Transfer - settings stored in a blueprint are preserved when rebuilding (excluding world-specific ones, such as per-duplicant settings)
[*] Placement Layer Filter - turn off building layers to place part of a blueprint
[*] Disable Blueprint buildings - right-click a building in the preview or building list to skip it for this placement; left-click to re-enable
[*] Preconfigure planned buildings - change settings on already-planned buildings by pasting a blueprint over them
[*] (limited) Blueprint Rotating / Flipping - the available rotations depend on the blueprint's contents. You can force a transformation, which removes incompatible buildings until the next placement
[*] Note Tool - leave text notes in the world as reminders, or note down which element belongs in specific tiles
[*] Integration with the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2982316671]Planning Tool[/url] mod
[/list]

Works with the base game and every DLC, and supports multiplayer through ONI Together.

[hr][/hr]

[h1]On the search for more blueprints?[/h1]
Check out [url=https://onimaxxing.com/blueprints/]onimaxxing[/url] or [url=https://blueprintnotincluded.org/]blueprintsnotincluded[/url].
(Blueprints created on onimaxxing keep most building setting configs, notes and building skins;
bpni does not support those currently.)

