[h1]Bug reports[/h1]

Please open an issue at [url=https://github.com/dytterud/oni-mods/issues]github.com/dytterud/oni-mods/issues[/url].

[b]Always include your full player.log[/b] — without it a report usually cannot be diagnosed:
[url=https://github.com/aki-art/ONI-Mods/wiki/How-to-send-a-log]how to find and send a log[/url].

Please also check whether the problem still happens with only this mod enabled, and say so in the
report — it is the single most useful thing you can tell me.

[h3]Update loop, or the mod marked as incompatible?[/h3]

Either the game failed its mod extraction step, or OneDrive is blocking folder access and stopping
the game writing mod files. Turn OneDrive off for your Documents folder as described in
[url=https://support.klei.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029880551-Oxygen-Not-Included-Troubleshooting-Guide]Klei's troubleshooting guide[/url],
then force an update of the mod.

You can also grab a direct download from
[url=https://github.com/dytterud/oni-mods/releases]GitHub releases[/url].
